  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Life; <strong>CL</strong> 8th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 75,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> —</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThis small, oval gem fits easily into a pocket, and refracts light as if it were a diamond. Whenever a positive energy healing effect occurs within 60 feet of the bearer, they benefit as if they had been targeted by an identical effect. The original targets of the healing effect still benefit. It has been suggested by some that powerful undead may create a corresponding opaque gem which would give the same effect for negative energy.</p>\n<p><strong>Note:</strong> This item only copies effects that do not already affect the user.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Life sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 37,500 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
